+F11 repeats stationary spell-only fights using names evidenced in your log. Stand at your chosen camp and turn native melee OFF. It automatically prepares learned spells, refreshes after dings and rests between fights. Stops at observed level 20 or a failed check. No buying/scribing, movement, loot input or vendors. F8 returns to assist; F9 stops.
+The complete 1–20 path is unfinished. Use separate preview 0.39.21 for movement. G0 passed; do not repeat it.
 
 SOURCE OF SPELL LEVELS
 The installed client's spells_us.txt is authoritative for this installation. The progression tab is a preview; your live bar is filtered against a fresh /outputfile spellbook export. No third-class skills are assumed.
